  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sports for Inclusion: Football against Racism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote inclusion of migrants in host societies through the common practice of football and to contribute to the fight against racial discrimination against vulnerable communities in Tunisia. The target is both migrant youth and host communities, using football to foster integration and reduce potential tensions between communities. IOM will provide football coaches with the necessary skills to combat racial discrimination in their communities, through training tailored to inclusion and living together.</narrative>
  </description>
